Casambi Lighting for Homey Pro
Independent community project; not affiliated with Casambi Technologies Oy, Flos or Athom.

The encryption and wire protocol implementation is a JavaScript adaptation of
lkempf/casambi-bt (Lukas Kempf and contributors), Apache License 2.0.
Reference revision ec23769ab3459abf8ba5f332267900964319d03e.
Adaptations include Homey BLE transport, early notification registration,
server digest and counter verification, generic bitfield profiles and shared
network connection management. Preserve this notice in redistributions.

No code from other Home Assistant integrations is included.
